 and Git and uses the `web` profile by default:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Install a pinned Git tag:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"See installation and updates for uninstalling or installing without Git."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Current release **v1.9.62**: release notes · troubleshooting"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Feature overview"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- **Conversation and call costs**: Cost entries in the composer, header and each turn. Inspect rates"},{"id":"p20s2","text":", tokens, recorded inputs and tool results, including parent/subagent cost attribution.\n- **Statisti"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"cs and exports**: Filter by date, provider and model; inspect trends, rankings, cache hit rates and "},{"id":"p20s4","text":"token heatmaps. Export one or all retained conversations, and view local-model API-equivalent costs "},{"id":"p20s5","text":"separately.\n- **Quotas and balances**: Codex / ChatGPT, OpenCode Go, MiniMax, Claude, GLM, Kimi, Qia"},{"id":"p20s6","text":"nwen, MiMo, OpenDesign and other plans, plus CLIProxyAPI multi-account quotas and custom HTTP balanc"},{"id":"p20s7","text":"e sources.\n- **Multi-provider pricing**: Automatic model matching, editable rates and multipliers, a"},{"id":"p20s8","text":"nd peak/off-peak tiers. Sync DeepSeek official prices and the OpenRouter catalog; separate API charg"},{"id":"p20s9","text":"es from Plan equivalents.\n- **Budgets and pricing alerts**: Daily, monthly, cumulative or custom-dat"},{"id":"p20s10","text":"e budgets. Peak/off-peak schedules and countdowns, with popup and system notifications before a chan"},{"id":"p20s11","text":"ge.\n- **Display and history**: Configure sidebar cards, composer entries, quota strips and turn cost"},{"id":"p20s12","text":"s. Chinese/English UI, dark themes and mobile layouts; historical imports, retention and storage con"},{"id":"p20s13","text":"nese/English UI, dark themes and mobile layouts; historical imports, retention and storage controls."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"See features and screenshots for entry points and model and plan support for providers and credentia"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" features and screenshots for entry points and model and plan support for providers and credentials."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Screenshots & walkthrough"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| Cost trends and model ranking | Conversation cost distribution |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| [](docs/images/statistics.png) | [](docs/images/treemap.png) |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| Subscription quotas and balances | Display settings and interactive preview |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| [](docs/images/quotas.png) | [](docs/images/display.png) |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Select an image for full resolution. More views: call details, prices, history, dark themes and mobi"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"ect an image for full resolution. More views: call details, prices, history, dark themes and mobile."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Documentation"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| Topic | Guides |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| Setup and use | Install, update and uninstall · Troubleshooting · Display settings |\n| Statistics "},{"id":"p30s2","text":"and billing | Billing rules · Statistics and details · Models and plans · Peak schedules |\n| Balance"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"s and quotas | Credentials · Custom balances · Gateway quotas · Plan estimates |\n| History and stora"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"ge | Retention and cleanup · Repricing · External usage · Ledger recovery |\n| Development | Architec"},{"id":"p30s5","text":"ture and development · Contributing · Host compatibility |\n| Releases | Update history · CHANGELOG |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Community"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Open an issue with plugin and host versions, reproduction steps and relevant logs. The WeChat group "},{"id":"p32s2","text":"is available for usage questions and feature discussions."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"MIT © 2026 dsh-cost-meter con